    W^X 違反・重複 mapping・unmap 後 access を別々の machine rejection にする。")))

  (:adr/addendum-2026-08-11-native-page-table-activation
  (map (:status "accepted; supersedes the activation part of the ownership-and-root addendum")
   (:dependency-authority
